{
  "name": "Brand-Pipe: format, brand and normalise a video",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Add the credential\nCreate a **Header Auth** credential named `Brand-Pipe API Key` with name `X-API-Key` and your key as the value, then select it on the *Brand-Pipe process* node. Get a key with 25 free credits at https://www.brand-pipe.com.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1001-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky: credential",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        340,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Replace the values\nSwap the four fields in *Set video* for the output of your own generator node (Kling, Sora, Runway, an S3 link, anything reachable over HTTPS); `format` is `vertical`, `square` or `landscape`.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1002-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Sticky: values",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Connect the binary output\n*Download result* puts the finished MP4 into the binary property `video`; connect your YouTube, TikTok or storage node to it. The lower branch stops the run with the message from the API, and failed jobs do not cost credits.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1003-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Sticky: output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "name": "video_url",
              "value": "https://test-videos.co.uk/vids/bigbuckbunny/mp4/h264/360/Big_Buck_Bunny_360_10s_1MB.mp4",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f2",
              "name": "logo_url",
              "value": "https://www.python.org/static/community_logos/python-logo.png",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f3",
              "name": "format",
              "value": "vertical",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f4",
              "name": "audio_normalize",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Set video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        380
      ],
      "notes": "Replace these values with the output of your video generator node."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.brand-pipe.com/v1/process",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ video_url: $json.video_url, logo_url: $json.logo_url, format: $json.format, audio_normalize: $json.audio_normalize }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id }}-{{ $itemIndex }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Brand-Pipe process",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        380
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Brand-Pipe API Key"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Credential: Header Auth, name X-API-Key, value your key. Timeout 5 min covers long clips."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.data.result_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "video"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Download result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Binary property 'video' holds the finished MP4. Connect your YouTube / TikTok / storage node here."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "=Brand-Pipe error: {{ $json.error }}"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Stop with error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        920,
        470
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Brand-Pipe process",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Brand-Pipe process": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Success?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Success?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Stop with error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
